# Dustwallow Marsh (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose SOURCE is physically in Dustwallow Marsh for a Horde player, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Nine recipes are vendor-sold by Horde in-zone vendors (every buy is pinned to its vendor); five more drop exclusively from in-zone mobs. Every other Dustwallow-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Leatherworking, Fishing, Engineering and Alchemy have no in-zone Horde source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-horde-recipes
title Dustwallow Marsh (Horde) - Recipes
levels 30-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords dustwallow, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking - Brackenwall (Ogg'marr)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 4879 -- Ogg'marr (36.7, 30.97), Butcher
  buy 12228 "Recipe: Roast Raptor" npc 4879
  buy 12232 "Recipe: Carrion Surprise" npc 4879
  buy 12239 "Recipe: Dragonbreath Chili" npc 4879
  buy 20075 "Recipe: Heavy Crocolisk Stew" npc 4879
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Tailoring - Brackenwall (Ghok'kah)

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 6567 -- Ghok'kah (35.15, 30.83), Tailoring Supplies
  buy 4355 "Pattern: Icy Cloak" npc 6567
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag" npc 6567
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag" npc 6567
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step First Aid - Brackenwall (Balai Lok'Wein)

  when skill First Aid 1

  vendor 13476 -- Balai Lok'Wein (36.49, 30.36), Potions, Scrolls and Reagents
  buy 16112 "Manual: Heavy Silk Bandage" npc 13476
  buy 16113 "Manual: Mageweave Bandage" npc 13476
  note Balai also sells the Expert First Aid book itself. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Blacksmithing - the north shore (rare drop)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 53.96,15.18
  goto 54.33,14.82
  goto 54.36,13.95
  goto 54.68,14.92
  goto 54.98,16.33
  goto 56.18,16.65
  goto 56.88,16.48
  goto 57.32,15.09
  goto 57.5,14.7
  goto 57.52,15.68
  goto 58.32,16.07
  goto 58.36,15.41
  goto 58.44,16.82
  goto 58.7,16.27
  collect 251459 "Plans: Mithril Shortsword" optional
  note Dropped only by the Mirefin Coastrunner (level 36), which patrols these points; the recipe drops nowhere else and has no vendor anywhere in the data.

