step Enchanting - the far south (rare drop)

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 36.8,69
  goto 38.2,66.8
  goto 38.4,68.6
  goto 39.4,64.4
  goto 40.6,66
  goto 41.6,73.2
  goto 42.6,68.6
  goto 43.8,64.4
  goto 44.6,81.8
  collect 249511 "Formula: Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Agility" optional
  note Dropped only by the Firemane Scout (level 41), which patrols these points - but the same scout also drops it in the Barrens, so this is a dual-zone drop, not Dustwallow-exclusive. No quest takes it in the data.

