step No Leatherworking, Fishing, Engineering or Alchemy source in-zone

  note Leatherworking, Fishing, Engineering and Alchemy have no recipe source physically in Dustwallow Marsh for a Horde player in the data - no servable in-zone vendor sells one (Alliance-held sources: Lindea Rabinne's line, Harggan, Nioma, Micha Yance) and no in-zone mob drops one - so this guide carries nothing for them. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.
